\v 9 Then¦155722 Adoniyah¦155723 sacrificed¦155722 sheep¦155724 and cattle¦155726 and fattened¦155726 calves near¦155727 the Zohelet stone¦155728 (which¦155730 is beside¦155732 Eyn-Rogel¦155734), and he¦155735 \add ≈invited\add* all his¦155740 brothers¦155740 (the king's sons¦155741), and all the men¦155745 of Yehudah¦155746 \add including\add* the king's servants¦155747.
\v 10 \add ≈However\add*, he didn't¦155762 invite¦155763 the prophet¦155753 Natan¦155752, Benayah¦155754, the \add ≈top warriors\add*, or his¦155761 brother¦155761 Shelomoh¦155760.
