\v 15 \add ≈So¦155852\add* Batsheva¦155853 \add ≈went¦155852 to the king's bedroom where\add* Avishag¦155863 (the Shunammite¦155864) was attending \add *him\add* \add ≈in his old¦155861 age\add*.
\v 16 Batsheva¦155871 bowed¦155870 \add ≈low¦155870 to show respect\add* to the¦155875 king¦155875, and¦155870 he¦155876 \add ≈asked her what¦155878 she wanted\add*.
