\s4 Full kingdom
\p
\v 10 Then¦156795 David \add ≈breathed his¦156799 last\add* and¦156800 was¦156800 buried¦156800 in¦156801 the¦156801 City¦156801 of¦156801 David.
\v 11 \add *He¦156808\add* had reigned¦156807 over¦156809 Yisrael¦156811 for forty¦156812 years—seven¦156816 years from Hebron¦156814 and thirty-three¦156820 years from Yerushalem¦156818.\x + \xo 2:11: \xt 2Sam 5:4-5; 1Ch 3:4.\x*
\v 12 Shelomoh \add ≈replaced\add* his father¦156830 David¦156829 on¦156826 the¦156828 throne¦156828, and¦156831 his \add ≈authority\add* was¦156831 established¦156831 \add ≈with firmness\add*.\x + \xo 2:12: \xt 1Ch 29:23.\x*
\s1 Adoniyah's provocation and death
\rem /s1 The Death of Adonijah; Solomon Consolidates His Reign; Solomon Establishes His Rule; Solomon's Throne Established
\s4 Full kingdom
\p
\v 13 Then¦156835 Haggit's¦156839 son¦156837 Adoniyah¦156836 came¦156835 to¦156841 Shelomoh's¦156848 mother¦156846 Batsheva¦156843 and¦156835 she¦156849 \add ≈asked\add* \add >him\add*, “Is¦156851 your¦156851 coming¦156851 peaceful¦156850?”
\p “\add ≈It¦156849 is¦156851\add*,” he¦156852 \add ≈replied\add*.
\v 14 “\add ≈Can I ask you¦156858 something?\add*”
\p “\add ≈Go ahead\add*,” she¦156859 answered.
\p
\v 15 “You yourself know¦156864 that the kingship was for me \add as the oldest son\add*,” he said¦156862, “and all Yisrael¦156874 \add ≈wanted\add* me to reign. \add ≈But¦156862 then Yahweh¦156882 decided that it was for my brother¦156880, and then everything got\add* turned¦156877 around.
\v 16 \add ≈So¦156886\add* now¦156886, I¦156889 \add ≈have only one¦156888 thing to¦156899 request from¦156891 you¦156891—please don't¦156892 refuse me\add*.”
\p “Go on,” she¦156898 said¦156898.
\p
\v 17 He¦156902 said¦156902, “Please¦156905 speak¦156903 to Shelomoh¦156906 the king¦156907 because¦156908 he wouldn't \add ≈refuse you\add*. \add Ask him\add* to give¦156915 me¦156917 Avishag¦156920 the Shunammite¦156921 as my wife.”\x + \xo 2:17: \xt 1Ki 1:3-4.\x*
\p
\v 18 “\add ≈Okay\add*,” Batsheva \add ≈agreed\add*, “I'll¦156930 \add ≈personally\add* speak¦156930 to¦156932 the¦156934 king¦156934 for you¦156931.”
