\p
\v 36 Then¦157356 the¦157357 king¦157357 \add ≈summoned\add* Shimei¦157359 and told him¦157361, “Build¦157362 yourself¦157364 a house¦157365 \add here\add* in¦157366 Yerushalem¦157366 and live¦157367 there. \add ≈But¦157356\add* don't¦157369 go¦157371 \add ≈anywhere else\add*
