\v 39 \add ≈However,\add* three¦157415 years¦157416 \add later\add*, two¦157418 of Shimei's¦157421 slaves fled¦157417 to¦157422 Maacah's¦157427 son¦157425, King¦157428 Akish¦157424 of Gat¦157429, and¦157430 Shimei was told¦157430 \add ≈where they'd gone\add*.
