\v 46 Then¦157550 the king¦157551 commanded¦157550 Yehoyada's¦157557 son¦157555 Benayah¦157554, and he¦157558 went¦157558 out¦157558 and put \add @Shimei\add* \add ≈to death\add*.
\p \add In those ways,\add* \add ≈Shelomoh¦157567 established¦157564 his control of the kingdom¦157563\add*.
