\v 41 “Also¦161494 the¦161497 foreigners¦161497 who are not¦161499 \add ≈descendants of\add* Yisrael¦161502 and¦161494 who came¦161504 from¦161505 distant¦161506 countries because of your¦161508 \add ≈reputation¦161508\add*
