\v 44 “\add ≈When\add* your people¦161569 go¦161568 out to battle¦161570 against the enemy¦161573, and on¦161574 the road where you sent¦161576 them they¦161577 pray¦161577 to \add you\add* Yahweh¦161580, in¦161574 this city¦161582 that you've¦161584 chosen¦161584, with¦161574 this house¦161586 that I've¦161589 built¦161589 for¦161590 your \add ≈honour\add*,
