\p
\v 46 “If they disobey you (because¦161607 everyone sins¦161613) and you're angry¦161614 with¦161615 them and \add ≈cause them to be defeated by their¦161620 enemies\add*, and then they get taken¦161619 prisoner and led away to the enemy's¦161624 country (even a far away country),
\v 47 and then¦161629 they \add ≈have a change of¦161632 mind¦161632\add* in the¦161633 land where¦161634 they were taken¦161635 to as captives¦161635, and while they're still living in that land, they turn back and beg for your favour¦161640 and confess, ‘We've disobeyed and done¦161646 wrong¦161646—we've¦161645 behaved wickedly¦161647,’
\v 48 and they return¦161649 to you with all their \add #hearts¦161653\add* and all their \add #souls\add* in¦161657 the land¦161657 of their enemies¦161658 where they were taken¦161661 captive¦161661, and they pray¦161663 to you toward the direction¦161665 of their country which¦161667 you gave¦161668 to their fathers, the city¦161670 that you chose¦161672, and the residence that I've¦161676 built¦161676 for¦161678 your¦161678 \add ≈honour\add*,
\v 49 then¦161680 \add ≈listen¦161680 to\add* their \add #prayers¦161686\add* and \add #requests\add* from your¦161683 abode in the heavens¦161681, and \add ≈help their situation\add*.
\v 50 Forgive¦161693 your¦161694 people¦161694 who've \add ≈disobeyed\add* you¦161705 and¦161693 \add ≡forgive¦161693\add* the \add ≈wicked things\add* that¦161702 they've¦161696 \add ≈done\add*. \add ≈Help their¦161701 captors¦161709 to be compassionate¦161707 to\add* them¦161710,
\v 51 because¦161712 \add they're\add* your people¦161714 and¦161715 your \add ≈special possession\add* who you¦161718 brought¦161718 out¦161718 from Egypt¦161719—from the middle of the iron-smelting furnace¦161721.
\p
\v 52 “May \add ≈you notice\add* the plea for favour from your servant¦161730 and¦161731 from your people¦161734 Yisrael¦161735—to listen¦161736 to them¦161737 in¦161738 all¦161738 their¦161739 crying out to you.
\v 53 Because¦161763 you yourself separated¦161745 them¦161745 for¦161746 yourself as a \add ≈special possession\add* out of all¦161748 the people¦161749 groups in¦161753 the world, just¦161751 as you said through your¦161756 servant¦161756 Mosheh¦161755 when¦161757 you brought¦161757 our ancestors¦161760 out from¦161761 Egypt¦161761, my¦161762 master¦161762 Yahweh¦161762.”
