\p
\v 54 Once Shelomoh¦161769 was¦161766 finished¦161768 praying¦161770 this prayer¦161777 and request for favour to Yahweh, he¦161780 stood¦161780 up¦161780 from¦161784 bowing¦161784 on¦161785 his knees¦161787 with his palms¦161788 spread¦161789 out¦161789 toward the¦161790 heavens¦161790 in front¦161781 of Yahweh's¦161773 altar¦161782,
