\v 56 “Blessed¦161803 be¦161803 Yahweh¦161804, who¦161805 has¦161806 given¦161806 \add ≈peace to\add* his people¦161808 Yisrael¦161809 \add ≈like he said he would\add*. \add ≈He didn't¦161813 fail to do even one¦161817 part out of all¦161810 the¦161820 good¦161820 things that he told his servant¦161825 Mosheh¦161824 that he'd do\add*.\x + \xo 8:56: \xt Deu 12:10; Josh 21:44-45.\x*
\v 57 May our god¦161829 Yahweh¦161828 be with us, just¦161831 as¦161831 he was¦161832 with our ancestors¦161835. May he not leave¦161838 us \add ≈or\add* abandon¦161841 us,
