\v 63 and King¦161943 Shelomoh¦161923 sacrificed¦161925 peace¦161926 offerings¦161926 to¦161929 Yahweh (twenty-two¦161931 thousand cattle¦161930 and one¦161935 hundred¦161935 and twenty thousand sheep¦161934) and the king¦161943 and the \add ≈Israelis¦161947\add* dedicated¦161938 Yahweh's¦161929 residence.
\v 64 On that day¦161949 the king¦161952 \add ≈reserved\add* the middle¦161955 of the courtyard¦161956 that was \add ≈in¦161958 front¦161958 of the temple\add*, because \add ≈that was where\add* he¦161964 made the burnt¦161968 up offerings and the grain¦161971 offerings and the fat pieces of the peace¦161974 offerings. \add This was\add* because the bronze¦161978 altar¦161977 was too¦161982 small¦161982 to \add ≈handle all those offerings\add*.
