\v 10 “You¦164219 should tell \add *them\add* this¦164221,” \add ≈his young companions replied\add*. “\add ≈They've asked that you should lighten¦164232 the load on them from what your father demanded, but¦164210 on the contrary, you should tell them that your little¦164237 finger¦164237 is¦164238 thicker¦164238 than¦164239 your father's¦164240 thigh bone was\add*.
