\p
\v 25 Then Yarave'am¦164571 built Shekem¦164574 in¦164575 the¦164575 hill¦164575 country¦164575 of¦164575 Efrayim¦164576 and he lived¦164577 \add ≈there\add* \add for a while\add*. Then he \add ≈left\add* there and built Penuel¦164584.
