\v 28 \add ≈So¦164628 after getting advice,\add* the king¦164629 made¦164630 two¦164631 gold¦164633 calves¦164632, and¦164628 he told¦164634 \add @his people\add*, “Going¦164639 \add all the way\add* \add ≈down\add* to¦164635 Yerushalem¦164640 is¦164636 too \add ≈far\add* for you. Look¦164641, \add these can be\add* your¦164642 gods¦164642, Yisrael¦164643, who brought¦164645 you out from¦164646 Egypt¦164647.”\x + \xo 12:28: \xt Exo 32:4.\x*
