\v 32 In¦164694 the eighth¦164695 month on the 15th, Yarave'am¦164691 \add ≈put on a celebration\add* like the one in¦164694 Yehudah¦164705. \add He'd made\add* an altar at¦164694 Beyt-El and he got the priests¦164725 from the \add ≈hill temples\add* he'd made to come and stand there, then¦164690 he offered a sacrifice¦164715 on that altar to the calves¦164716 that he'd made.\x + \xo 12:32-33: \xt Lev 23:33-34.\x*
