\v 14 after¦165087 the man of God, and¦165086 found¦165090 him sitting¦165091 under¦165092 an oak tree. “Are¦165096 you¦165096 the man of God,” he¦165104 \add ≈asked\add* him, “who¦165100 came¦165102 from¦165103 Yehudah¦165103?”
\p “I¦165105 am¦165105,” he said¦165104.
