\p
\v 33 \add ≈Despite\add* \add @the man of God's warning\add*, \add King\add* Yarave'am¦165473 didn't¦165470 \add ≈stop his evil¦165475 ways\add*—\add in fact\add* he \add ≈chose more people¦165479 from across the country to become\add* priests. \add ≈Anyone who wanted¦165482 to be a priest would be appointed\add* and he would become one of the priests of the \add ≈hilltop¦165481 worship\add* places¦165489.
\v 34 \add ≈Those were the sins¦165494 of Yarave'am¦165496 that¦165493 would eventually lead to the rejection and¦165491 destruction¦165498 of his entire family\add*.
