\v 17 \add ≈So¦165851\add* Yarave'am's¦165853 wife¦165852 \add ≈left and¦165851 went¦165855 home\add* to¦165856 Tirtsah¦165856. \add ≈As she¦165857 entered the¦165859 doorway of¦165859 their home, their son\add* died¦165863.
