\v 21 \add ≈Meanwhile,\add* Shelomoh's¦165920 son¦165918 Rehavam reigned in¦165922 Yehudah¦165922. He was forty-one¦165925 when¦165929 he \add started\add* reigning, and¦165930 he reigned for seventeen¦165930 years¦165927 from¦165946 Yerushalem¦165935—the city¦165936 that Yahweh¦165940 had¦165939 chosen¦165939 \add ≈to¦165941 associate his¦165944 name¦165944 with¦165922\add* out of all¦165946 the tribes¦165947 of Yisrael¦165948. \add @Rehavam's\add* mother¦165950 was Naamah¦165951 the Ammonite¦165952.
