\v 31 Then¦166109 Rehavam (his mother¦166121 was Naamah¦166122 the Ammonite¦166123) \add ≈died\add* and was buried¦166114 with¦166118 his ancestors¦166113 in¦166118 the City¦166118 of David¦166119, and his son¦166126 Abiyyam \add ≈replaced him¦166127 as king¦166124\add*.
