\v 1 In¦166130 the eighteenth¦166131 year¦166130 of (Nabat's son¦166135) King¦166133 Yarave'am's¦166134 \add reign over Israel\add*, Abiyyam \add ≈became¦166138 king¦166138 of Yehudah¦166142\add*.
\v 2 (His¦166149 mother's¦166149 name¦166148 was¦166150 Maakah¦166150, \add one of\add* Abishalom's¦166153 daughters¦166151.) He reigned¦166146 from Yerushalem¦166147 for three years¦166145
\v 3 \add ≈but¦166155\add* he \add ≈disobeyed God¦166172 in ways similar to\add* his father—\add ≈he wasn't interested in following his god¦166172 Yahweh¦166171 completely¦166168 like¦166173 his ancestor David¦166174 had¦166162 done¦166162\add*.
