\p
\v 9 In¦166271 the¦166274 twentieth¦166272 year¦166271 of King¦166274 Yarave'am's¦166273 \add reign over\add* Yisrael¦166275, Asa¦166277 \add ≈became¦166276 king of Yehudah¦166279\add*
