\v 25 In¦166619 the¦166612 second year¦166619 of Asa's¦166621 \add ≈reign over¦166616 Yehudah¦166623\add*, Yarave'am's¦166614 son¦166612 Nadav¦166611 became¦166615 king¦166622 of Yisrael¦166618 where he¦166624 reigned¦166624 for two¦166628 years¦166628.
