\p
\v 27 \add A man named\add* Baasha¦166646 (from the Yissakar¦166651 tribe) plotted against \add @King Nadav\add* and \add ≈killed him¦166652 at¦166654 the Philistine city of¦166651 Gibbeton¦166654\add* when Nadav and all¦166658 Yisrael¦166660 were¦166661 besieging \add *the city\add*.
