\v 29 As soon as he \add ≈took over\add*, he \add ≈had Yarave'am's¦166684 entire¦166681 family executed—not leaving¦166687 a single one of them alive. This fulfilled what Yahweh¦166696 had said through\add* his servant¦166701 Ahiyah¦166702 the Shilonite¦166703,\x + \xo 15:29: \xt 1Ki 14:10.\x*
\v 30 because Yarave'am's¦166708 \add own\add* sins¦166707, as well as his¦166716 causing¦166712 Yisrael¦166715 to¦166718 sin¦166712, had provoked¦166718 Yahweh¦166721 into getting angry.
\p
\v 31 \add ≈Everything else that¦166730 Nadav¦166727 did¦166731 is written¦166735 in the book of the events\add* of the kings¦166741 of Yisrael¦166742.
