\v 28 Then¦167329 Omri¦167330 \add ≈died\add* and was¦167334 buried¦167334 in¦167335 Shomron¦167335, and his¦167339 son¦167338 Ahav¦167337 \add !(Ahab¦167337)\add* \add ≈replaced him¦167339 as king¦167336\add*.
