\p
\v 19 The provincial¦169644 commanders' young¦169642 men¦169642 exited the city¦169641 followed¦169647 by the \add ≈warriors¦169642\add*
\v 20 and¦169649 each of¦169651 them killed¦169649 their opponent. Then¦169649 the Arameans¦169653 \add ≈took off with the Israelis¦169655\add* chasing them, \add ≈but¦169649\add* King¦169660 Ben¦169657-Hadad¦169659 escaped¦169656 on¦169662 a horse¦169664 along with other riders.
