\v 22 \add ≈Afterwards\add* \add that same\add* prophet¦169683 went¦169682 \add back\add* to¦169684 King¦169686 Ahav and told him¦169689, “Go¦169690 \add back and\add* \add ≈fortify your defenses and plan your strategy\add*, because¦169698 Aram's¦169702 king¦169701 \add ≈will¦169703 attack you¦169704 again¦169704 at the same time next\add* year¦169700.”
