\p
\v 23 \add ≈Meanwhile\add* the servants¦169707 of Aram's¦169710 king¦169708 told him, “Their gods are the gods of the hills¦169714, so¦169718 that's why they¦169719 were¦169719 stronger¦169719 than us. \add ≈But¦169707\add* let's fight them on¦169724 the plain¦169724 instead¦169721 \add ≈then we'll¦169728 be¦169728 sure to defeat\add* them.
