\v 28 A man¦169810 of God approached¦169809 Yisrael's¦169816 king¦169815 and told \add <him\add*, “Yahweh says¦169820 \add ≈that the Arameans¦169825\add* have¦169824 been saying¦169812 that he's a god¦169831 of the hills¦169827, but¦169809 not of the valleys¦169832. \add ≈Because¦169844 of that, he's going to help you defeat this huge¦169840 army\add*, and then¦169809 you'll know¦169843 that Yahweh \add ≈is God\add*.”
