\v 29 \add @The¦169867 two armies\add* \add ≈remained camped¦169849 opposite¦169851 each other for\add* seven¦169853 days¦169854, then¦169849 the battle¦169860 \add ≈began and¦169849 the Israelis¦169864 killed¦169861 a hundred¦169868 thousand¦169870 Aramean¦169865 soldiers¦169871 that\add* day¦169872.
