\v 33 The men¦169962 \add ≈were looking for an indication\add* \add of mercy\add* and¦169964 \add ≈when they heard that they were encouraged\add*. “\add Yes,\add*, Ben¦169969-Hadad¦169971 is \add like\add* your brother¦169968,” they said.
