\v 34 and he¦169985 told \add @Ahav\add*, “I'll return¦169995 the¦169987 cities¦169987 that my father took¦169990 from with¦169999 \add ≈yours¦169998\add*, and \add ≈your¦169994 traders can set up stalls\add* in Damascus¦169999, just¦170000 as¦170000 my father \add ≈did\add* in Shomron¦170004.”
