\p
\v 35 \add One day,\add* a prophet¦170018 \add ≈in¦170023 training with¦170023 a group\add* told his¦170022 companion, “By Yahweh's¦170024 command, please¦170026 wound me¦170025.” \add ≈But¦170015\add* the¦170028 man¦170028 refused¦170027 to¦170029 \add ≈slash\add* him¦170029,
\v 36 \add ≈so\add* the \add first\add* prophet told him, “Because¦170040 you didn't¦170035 \add ≈obey Yahweh's¦170039 command\add*, listen¦170037, \add ≈as soon as you leave here you'll be attacked by a\add* lion.” Then¦170031 after he¦170045 \add ≈left\add*, a lion found¦170047 him and¦170031 \add ≈killed¦170049\add* him.\x + \xo 20:36: \xt 1Ki 13:24.\x*
