\v 43 Then¦170171 the¦170172 king¦170172 went¦170171 \add on\add* to¦170175 his¦170177 house¦170177 in Shomron¦170181, \add but he was\add* \add ≈angry¦170179 and¦170171 depressed inside\add*.
\c 21
\s1 Navot's vineyard
\rem /s1 Naboth's Vineyard
