\p
\v 1 \add ≈Sometime after¦170185 that¦170192\add*, King¦170197 Ahav¦170196 from Shomron¦170198 \add was in his\add* palace¦170195 in Yizreel¦170193 city, and¦170184 \add ≈his neighbour was\add* the Yezreelite¦170191 Navot \add !(Naboth¦170190)\add* \add ≈with¦170193 his\add* vineyard¦170188.
\v 2 Ahav¦170201 \add ≈pressured\add* Navot¦170204, “Give¦170208 me¦170210 your¦170233 vineyard \add ≈so I can make it into my vegetable¦170219 garden¦170217\add* because¦170220 it's¦170221 right beside¦170223 my house¦170224. \add ≈I can replace it with¦170233\add* a better vineyard, \add ≈or if¦170231 you prefer, I can pay you in¦170233 silver for¦170236\add* this¦170239 one.”
