\v 3 \add ≈But¦170241\add* Navot¦170242 \add ≈replied\add*, “Far¦170246 be¦170246 it¦170246 for¦170247 me¦170247 \add ≈to disobey\add* Yahweh¦170248 by giving¦170249 up the¦170252 inheritance¦170252 \add ≈entrusted to\add* my¦170249 ancestors¦170253.”
