\v 4 \add ≈So¦170256\add* Ahav¦170257 went \add back\add* to his palace bitter and angry¦170262 \add ≈because of Navot's¦170270 refusal to turn¦170285 over the land\add*. He \add ≈refused to eat¦170291\add* and \add ≈went\add* to bed¦170284 with his face¦170288 towards the wall,
\v 5 \add ≈but¦170294\add* his¦170297 wife¦170297 Izevel¦170296 went¦170294 in and \add ≈demanded\add*, “What's this¦170302 \add ≈about¦170303 eating¦170306 nothing and going to bed in a sulk\add*?”
