\v 6 “\add ≈Well,\add* I talked with¦170326 Navot¦170316 the Yezreelite¦170317,” he \add ≈replied\add*. “\add ≈I offered to pay cash¦170326 for his vineyard¦170325 or¦170327 to exchange it for another one if¦170328 he preferred, but¦170309 he wouldn't let me have it\add*.”
