\v 7 “\add What!\add* \add ≈You're the king of\add* Yisrael¦170356!” his wife¦170349 \add ≈responded¦170346\add*. “Get up \add and\add* \add ≈have something to¦170365 eat¦170358 and cheer¦170361 up\add*! I'll¦170364 \add ≈make sure myself that you get\add* Navot's¦170369 vineyard¦170368.”
