\v 17 Then Yahweh¦170544 told Eliyah¦170547 (from Tishbe¦170548),
\v 18 “\add ≈Leave here\add* \add and\add* go¦170552 to Yisrael's¦170557 king¦170555 Ahav¦170554 in Shomron¦170559. Listen, he's there¦170566 in Navot's¦170562 vineyard¦170561, where¦170563 he's gone¦170565 to \add ≈take¦170567 possession¦170567 of¦170567\add* it¦170567.
