\v 23 Also¦170657 concerning¦170659 Izevel¦170659, Yahweh¦170661 says¦170662 that the¦170663 dogs¦170663 will¦170664 eat \add *her body\add* by Yezreel's¦170669 \add city\add* \add ≈wall\add*.\x + \xo 21:23: \xt 2Ki 9:36.\x*
