\p
\v 25 Surely there was never \add ≈anyone¦170685 else as evil¦170690 as Ahav¦170686 who¦170687 sold¦170688 his soul by doing¦170689 what Yahweh¦170692 was said was wrong—albeit often\add* incited¦170695 by his wife¦170698 Izevel¦170697.
