\p
\v 1 Then¦170774 \add almost\add* three¦170775 years¦170776 went by without war¦170778 between¦170779 Aram¦170780 \add !(Syria¦170780)\add* and¦170781 Yisrael¦170782,
\v 2 \add ≈but¦170785\add* in¦170786 the third¦170787 year¦170786, Yehudah's¦170792 King¦170790 Yehoshafat¦170789 went \add ≈up north\add* to¦170793 visit Yisrael's¦170796 king¦170795.
\p
\v 3 \add While they were talking,\add* King¦170799 Ahav said¦170798 to¦170802 his¦170804 servants¦170804, “Do¦170805 you know¦170805 that¦170806 Ramot¦170809-Gilead¦170810 \add ≈should be ours, but¦170798 we¦170811 haven't reclaimed\add* it¦170814 from¦170815 Aram's¦170817 king¦170816?”
