\p “\add ≈You¦170823 and me¦170834 are together\add*,” Yehoshafat told Yisrael's¦170833 king¦170832. “\add ≈My¦170836 people are your people, and my¦170838 horses are your horses\add*.”
\v 5 \add ≈Then¦170841 he¦170841 added\add*, “\add ≈But¦170841 let's ask Yahweh¦170854\add* \add about it first\add*.”
