\v 6 \add ≈So¦170856\add* Yisrael's¦170859 king¦170857 gathered¦170856 about¦170863 four¦170863 hundred¦170864 prophets¦170862 together¦170856 and¦170856 asked them¦170867, “Should I¦170868 \add ≈attack\add* Ramot¦170871-Gilead¦170872, or \add ≈not\add*?”
\p “Go \add ≈ahead\add*, because \add #our\add* master¦170880\f + \fr 22:6 \ft Note that they don't mention ‘Yahweh’ here.\f* will give¦170879 \add ≈you victory\add*,” they \add ≈answered\add*.
