\v 7 \add ≈But¦170884\add* Yehoshafat¦170885 \add ≈asked\add*, “Is¦170892 there¦170886 no prophet¦170888 of Yahweh¦170889 still¦170890 \add around\add* here¦170887 \add ≈that¦170891 we¦170891 can ask\add*?”
