\v 8 “There's still¦170902 one¦170905 man¦170903 \add ≈who speaks¦170931 for\add* Yahweh¦170909,” \add @Ahav\add* \add ≈replied\add* to¦170906 Yehoshafat¦170928, “Yimla's¦170926 son Mikayehu¦170923, but¦170894 I¦170911 myself hate¦170912 him because¦170913 he \add ≈never prophesies¦170916 anything\add* good¦170918 about¦170917 me—\add ≈only negative things\add*.”
