\v 10 \add ≈Now\add* Yisrael's¦170950 king \add Ahav\add* and Yehudah's¦170954 king Yehoshafat¦170951 were \add ≈both wearing their¦170959 royal robes and sitting¦170955 on¦170962 thrones¦170959 at¦170962 a gate¦170964 in¦170962 Shomron's¦170965 city wall, and many prophets¦170968 were speaking messages to them¦170970\add*.
