\v 12 All¦170994 the¦170996 \add other\add* prophets¦170996 were¦170997 prophesying¦170997 \add ≈similarly\add*, saying¦170999 \add things like\add*, “\add Yes,\add* \add ≈attack\add* Ramot¦171001-Gilead¦171002 and be successful¦171003, and Yahweh¦171005 will \add ≈restore it¦171004 back to you\add*.”
